{"ref":"BDB, צְפַנְיָה(וּ)","hw":"צְפַנְיָה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צְפַנְיָה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Σοφονιας <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath treasured;</em> OHeb. <span dir=\"rtl\">צפניהו</span>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">צפנבעל</span><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  priest, -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.1\">Je 21:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.25\">22:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.24\">52:24</a> = -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.18\">2 K 25:18</a> (𝔊L Σαφανιας), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.3\">Je 37:3</a>. Elsewhere -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>:<br><strong>2.</strong>  the prophet <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.1\">Zp 1:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Judæan <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:10-14\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.10-14\">Zc 6:10–14</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  ancestor of Heman <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.21\">1 Ch 6:21</a> (Σαφανιας; = <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּרִיאֵל</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.9\">9</a>).","next":"BDB, מַצְפּוֹן","prev":"BDB, צְפוֹן²"}